  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/rc_gamma_utils_title.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>簡單乾淨的Gamma模組，支援所有模組載入器，無需繁複設定。</h2><h3>功能：</h3><ul>\n<li>按下<code>H</code>鍵即可開啟全亮模式</li>\n<li>按鍵綁定可自行設定</li>\n<li>安裝Iris光影並啟用光影時，會啟用夜視效果而非全Gamma亮度</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Stein-N/resources/main/images/resource_gamma_utils/resource_gamma_util_example.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
